msgid ""
"You have selected multiple frames.\n"
"You can only delete one frame at the time."
msgstr ""
"Vi elektis plurajn kadrojn.\n"
"Vi povas forigi nur unu kadron samtempe."

#: kword_page.cc:1341
msgid ""
"You have not selected a frame.\n"
"You need to select a frame first in order to delete it."
msgstr ""
"Vi ne elektis kadron.\n"
"Vi devas elekti kadron unue por forigi ĝin."

#: kword_page.cc:1349
