msgstr "Forigu tabelon"

#: kword_page.cc:1379
msgid ""
"You are about to delete the last Frame of the\n"
"Frameset '%1'.\n"
"Doing so will delete this Frameset and all the\n"
"text contained in it as well!\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure you want to do that?"
